WEBVTT

00:44:58.958 --> 00:45:03.518
I'm constantly networking
before the word ever existed.

00:45:03.542 --> 00:45:04.809
And so is my life.

00:45:04.833 --> 00:45:07.809
I knew share economy
before the term was invented.

00:45:07.833 --> 00:45:10.559
And I think that's where
the asking for help comes from.

00:45:10.583 --> 00:45:12.143
But the same is true in reverse.

00:45:12.167 --> 00:45:14.268
You can ask me for stuff, I don't blink.

00:45:14.292 --> 00:45:17.393
It's like, of course, if I can, I will.

00:45:17.417 --> 00:45:18.726
I love to feel important.

00:45:18.750 --> 00:45:23.226
I love to feel like I can give something
and facilitate something.

00:45:23.250 --> 00:45:24.934
It gives me tremendous joy.

00:45:24.958 --> 00:45:28.434
AG: I think what's so interesting
about how courageous you are in asking

00:45:28.458 --> 00:45:31.268
is that it empowers the people
you know to ask.